What
In the PAL catalogue (config/pal/levels/functions.tsv), the 24 menu accessors func_PAL_L00_0030F090 … func_PAL_L00_0030FE60 share one fingerprint (69b27b9a024d3fc2). In levels 05, 10, 15 and 25, their places are shifted by one function.
Each accessor is 60 bytes and does the same thing:
int value = D_L00_001A904C_2;
if (value != 0)
    return handler(value + OFFSET, argument);
return 0;
Only OFFSET (lui $a0, 0x3 / ori $a0, $a0, …) and the handler differ between them. The fingerprint hides…
